WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.860
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's look at images and screenshots.

00:00:04.846 --> 00:00:07.326
Kitty graphics draw pictures in any pane.

00:00:07.936 --> 00:00:09.936
Move the pane, and the picture goes with it.

00:00:11.101 --> 00:00:15.741
Control B, then shift C, captures a pane, the screen, or a region.

00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:18.389
The preview shows the PNG it wrote.

00:00:20.014 --> 00:00:23.527
From a script, tuios screenshot does the same.

00:00:27.301 --> 00:00:29.941
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
